\f1\fs22 Lonnie found them a room\'97a reluctant innkeeper reneging on a Cloudborne\'92s reservation. Less than salubrious, but it would have to do.\
Sarah and Chanta got in bed together, an arrangement far more comfortable for Sarah than Chanta. He hoped for sex, she knew there would be none. Yet, regardless of their respective ardour, both fell asleep the moment the moth-eaten pillowcases touched their heads.\
