\f1\fs22 Sarah feared the disc as much as the pursuit of deranged PAPER agents. For the first time, she felt the engine of her own destiny was broken.\
Beneath that lay a deeper unease. In the clarity of morning, Sarah remembered another dream: being visited by a tall, sinister vampire with an unholy beard, clad in Elvi regalia. The worst part? He hadn\'92t sucked anything from her. Sarah was sure, with a cold certainty, that he had injected her with something.
